{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15650","headline":"衞明府寄枇杷叶以诗荅 · 司空曙","name":"衞明府寄枇杷叶以诗荅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"倾筐呈绿叶，重叠色何鲜。\n讵是秋风里，犹如晓露前。\n仙方当见重，消疾本应便。\n全胜甘蕉赠，空投谢氏篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15650.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15650","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}